    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "intro",
      "label": "Intro",
      "default": "<p>Thank you for your interest in becoming an Apex Feeds wholesale partner. At Apex Feeds, we are committed to supplying premium feeder insects, frozen, freeze-dried and dehydrated meal foods, reptile nutrition products, and pet care essentials to independent pet stores, and industry professionals throughout Australia.</p><p>Our wholesale program is designed to provide retailers with competitive margins, reliable supply, quality products, and ongoing support to help grow their business and deliver value to their customers.</p><p>Whether you are looking to stock our live feeder insects, our premium reptile buffet foods, NutriCore Basics Range, Frozen Buffet Meals, Freeze-Dried Insect Range, Supplements, or Insect Hydration product range, Apex Feeds aims to provide a dependable wholesale solution backed by exceptional service.</p>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "start_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Start the application form" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Important information panel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "info_title", "label": "Title", "default": "Important information" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "info_subtitle", "label": "Subtitle", "default": "Please read carefully before submitting your wholesale application" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "requirements_title", "label": "First heading", "default": "Wholesale account requirements" },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "requirements_text",
      "label": "First text",
      "default": "<p>To maintain the integrity of our retail network and support our existing wholesale partners, applicants must meet the following minimum requirements:</p><ul><li>Operate an established brick-and-mortar retail business.</li><li>Hold all required licences, permits, and registrations relevant to their business activities.</li><li>Maintain a professional retail presence suitable for the products supplied by Apex Feeds.</li></ul><p>Please note that wholesale accounts will not be approved for:</p><ul><li>Hobby breeders or hobby businesses.</li><li>Home-based resellers.</li><li>Businesses operating solely through social media platforms.</li><li>Online-only businesses without an established physical retail location.</li></ul>"
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "approval_title", "label": "Second heading", "default": "Account approval" },
